# =============================================================================
# FocusShield .gitignore
#
# Rule of thumb: only real source, docs, build scripts and small test fixtures
# belong in this repository. Anything secret, machine-specific, generated,
# large or purely local stays out.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets and signing material (never commit) -----------------------------
# Real signing keys live outside the repo; passwords come from environment vars.
.env
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
keystore.txt
my-upload-key.jks

# Local machine config (Android SDK path etc.).
local.properties

# Firebase project config carries a project API key; each dev supplies their own.
google-services.json

# --- Build outputs -----------------------------------------------------------
# Releases are published as GitHub Release assets and fetched by the in-app
# updater (docs/UPDATE_SYSTEM.md). A checked-in APK/AAB is dead weight that goes
# stale, so the binary formats below are always ignored.
build/
app/build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*
*.stackdump

# --- Logs and crash reports --------------------------------------------------
*.log
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
npm-debug.log*
.firebase/

# --- Local tooling and agent state -------------------------------------------
# Editor/IDE state.
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.fleet/

# Coding-agent sessions, MCP server config and local skill manifests.
.claude/
.agents/
.mcp.json
skills-lock.json
opencode.json

# Local AI/scratch metadata and one-off patch scripts whose edits are applied.
metadata.json
prompt.txt
insert_glass.py
patch.py
.aistudio/

# --- Large media and generated assets ----------------------------------------
# Screen recordings and reference PDFs belong in Releases (or nowhere), not in
# git history. public/ was an AI-Studio export that no source file references.
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
public/
FocusSheild.svg

# --- Vendored reference project ----------------------------------------------
# A separate Android app (com.zenlock.focusguard) kept only as an algorithm
# reference; FocusShield's own code merely cites the "Zenlock Classifier
# pattern" in comments, so this folder is not part of the app.
zenlock_repo/

# --- Node / Firebase tooling -------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# --- OS and editor junk ------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*~
